he professor is waiting\nfor you.","id":"61-7-0-block-1","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"(girl player, probably)","id":"61-7-0-block-2","gender":"female"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Ethan: [Player]!\nDid you already collect eight Badges?\n\nThat’s so cool!\n\nThe professor is waiting\nfor you.","id":"61-7-0-block-3","gender":"female"},{"type":"note","text":"You both walk up to Elm. Boy and girl players hear the same words from him. You receive a Master Ball; if your Bag is full you do not get it, the same lines still play, and it is not offered again.","id":"61-7-0-block-4","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: Hi, [Player]!\nYou never cease to amaze me!\n\nThanks to you, my research is\ngoing great!\n\nTake this as a token of my\nappreciation.","id":"61-7-0-block-5","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"These two are probably Elm too (no name is shown):","id":"61-7-0-block-6","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"The Master Ball is the best!\n\nIt’s the ultimate Poké Ball! It’ll catch\nany Pokémon without fail.\n\nIt’s given only to noted\nPokémon researchers.\n\nI think you can make much better\nuse of it than I can, [Player]!","id":"61-7-0-block-7","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"By the way...\n\nWe just had a group of beautiful\nKimono Girls looking for you.","id":"61-7-0-block-8","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Your friend steps up to you, then walks out. Boy and girl players hear the same words except the name (Lyra for a boy player, Ethan for a girl player, probably).","id":"61-7-0-block-9","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Lyra: [Player], people are talking\nabout you!\n\nI heard you helped Kimono Girls?\n\nYou’ve been helping all these people!\nYou make me proud to be your friend.","id":"61-7-0-block-10","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"Elm ends the scene with his Kimono Girls line (\"The Kimono Girls are waiting for you at the Ecruteak Dance Theater.\", under \"Professor Elm\" below)