n was saying\nover the phone.\n\nYou seem to be there when\nsomething exciting happens,\n\n[Player]!\n\nYou are making me all excited!\nI’ll give you a present for that.\n\nPlease take it.","id":"61-11-12-block-4","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"You receive an Everstone (if your Bag is full you get nothing and he tries again next time). Then:","id":"61-11-12-block-5","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: That’s an Everstone.\n\nA Pokémon changes its shape as\nit evolves.\n\nBut if it’s holding an Everstone,\nyou can prevent it from evolving.\n\nIf you like the way a Pokémon is now,\nhave it hold an Everstone!\n\nProfessor Elm: [Player], good luck\nwith your journey!\n\nOh, one more thing...\nDon’t forget about my research!","id":"61-11-12-block-6","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":true,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01d","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#39)","condition":"flag 114 clear, 2435 set, lead is Togepi line","source":"843 F#39; 543 m46"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01e","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#60/#68); male","condition":"after 01d; flag 264 / 265 clear","source":"843 F#60,#68; 543 m47"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01ai","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"as 01e; female","condition":"as 01e","source":"843 F#60,#68; 543 m48"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01f","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#39/#59); male","condition":"after 01d; flag 264 / 265 set","source":"843 F#39,#59; 543 m104"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01aj","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"as 01f; female","condition":"as 01f","source":"843 F#39,#59; 543 m105"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01h","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after Everstone given (F#68/#69)","condition":"item space for Everstone","source":"843 F#68,#69; 543 m49"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01i",