\nCan I take a look at it closely?\n\nHmm...\nOne of the ears is spiky...\n\nThat’s strange.\n\nThere seems to be something more to it.\n\nIt really is a rare sight.\n\nYou met it at the Ilex Forest?\n\nA mysterious Pokémon called CELEBI\nhas been sighted there, or so I heard.\n\nSpeaking of that...\n\nProfessor Oak once wrote about\nCELEBI and Time Travel in a research\n\npaper he presented at a conference!\n\nProfessor Elm: CELEBI can use its\nmystic power called Time Travel...to\n\ntravel to the past and future.\n\nIf this PICHU has traveled through\ntime, perhaps you should take\n\nextra care of it, [Player].\n\nIt seems that this PICHU has been\naffected by traveling so far through\n\ntime with CELEBI.\n\nI’ll inform the Pokémon Center of it.\n\nThe lady at the reception should be\nable to tell you if anything may affect\n\nthat PICHU.","id":"61-11-14-block-1","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01s","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#31, Pichu check); male","condition":"form-1 Pichu lead, var 0x412F=0","source":"843 F#31; 543 m84"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01as","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"as 01s; female","condition":"as 01s","source":"843 F#31; 543 m85"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01t","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after 01s (F#4)","condition":"as 01s","source":"843 F#4; 543 m75"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01u","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after 01t (F#4)","condition":"as 01s","source":"843 F#4; 543 m76"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01v","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after 01u (F#4)","condition":"as 01s","source":"843 F#4; 543 m77"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01w","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after 01v (F#4)","condition":"as 01s","source":"843 F#4; 543 m78"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01x","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after 01w (F#4)","condition":"as 01s","source":"843 F#4; 543 m79"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01y","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after 01x (F#32/#33)","condition":"as 01s","source":"843 F#32,#33; 543 m80"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01z","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after 01y (F#57/#58); male","condition":"as 01s","source":"843 F#57,#58; 543 m81"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01at","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"as 01z; female","condition":"as 01s","source":"843 F#57,#58; 543 m82"}]},{"id":"61-11-15","condition":"you talk to him again before leaving the lab.","stages":[],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-01aa"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: This PICHU doesn’t\nseem like a regular PICHU.\n\nI’ll find out more about it.","id":"61-11-15-block-0","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01aa","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk again, var 0x4006 = 1 (F#28)","condition":"var 0x4006 = 1","source":"843 F#28; 543 m83"}]},{"id":"61-11-16","condition":"a later visit, once the Pichu is very fond of you. Until then he uses his usual line.","stages":[],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-01ab","NBT-DLG-061-01au","NBT-DLG-061-01ac","NBT-DLG-061-01ad","NBT-DLG-061-01ae"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: Hi, [Player]!\n\nOh, wow, your Spiky-eared PICHU seems\nto like you a lot already, [Player].\n\nSomething’s funny...\nI would expect it to evolve into\n\nPIKACHU since it likes its Trainer\n\nthis much...\n\nLet me see...\n\nHmm...\n\nCould it be...\n\nJust as I thought!\n\nIt seems that this PICHU will never\nevolve. It’s so strange!\n\nIts structure and the traveling\nthrough time must have affected\n\nits DNA.\n\nI’ve never heard of a Pokémon that\ndoesn’t evolve when it’s\n\nsupposed to...!","id":"61-11-16-block-0","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,